{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106080","id":2497500066,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6U3NOi","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106080","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106080.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106080.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106080","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106080/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106080/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106080/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e248c6f01a3de75fd6378d4650f070919c4598c5","number":106080,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Allow export nodes to be dropped in with ALT key","user":{"login":"cruglet","id":175854316,"node_id":"U_kgDOCntS7A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175854316?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruglet","html_url":"https://github.com/cruglet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruglet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruglet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruglet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruglet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruglet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruglet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruglet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruglet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruglet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Resolves proposal [#11897](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/11897).\r\n\r\nThis allows for the `ALT` or `OPTION (macOS)` key to be used as a way to drop `@export` variables automatically into the GDScript editor. `CTRL` takes precedence, so having both `ALT` and `CTRL` pressed will create an `@onready` variable.\r\n\r\nA possible extension of this implementation would be to automatically assign the corresponding node property to all nodes who share the same script in the current scene through the `_find_all_node_for_script` method. However, a large issue is that you would have to wait for the `property_list_changed` signal before actually applying anything, having to connect & disconnect independently for each node. In addition, I also found that setting the properties manually would not actually apply the changes properly, as saving the script/scene would reset these variables back to null. (Some advice as to how this could be implemented would be greatly appreciated 🙏)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-05-04T21:04:02Z","updated_at":"2025-05-12T12:50:27Z","cl